# 7.11 MISATO (5.13s) Get up. Shinji, get up! It isn't finished, and neither are you.
scoreboard players set #line angel.story 711
function angel:say/live_try
execute if score #live angel.story matches 1 run scoreboard players set #talking angel.story 1
execute if score #live angel.story matches 1 run scoreboard players set #line_left angel.story 167
